I don't think this is related to the Live Data macro:

* {quote}superadmin is not proposed{quote}
{{superadmin}} is a fake user, it doesn't exist so the user picker doesn't suggest it; we could improve the service that provides user suggestion to include it; note that filtering on {{XWiki.superadmin}} works
* {quote}selecting Adming returns 0 results{quote}
The problem is that the wiki manager sets the wiki owner using the absolute reference; since all wiki descriptors are on the main wiki, the owner references should be related to the main wiki (i.e. relative to the wiki descriptor page, e.g. if the owner is from the main wiki then the wiki reference part should be omitted). This needs to be fixed in the wiki manager.

